  "semantic_limits": [
    "Cannon link stores BlockPos only, no dimension or cannon UUID. Actual getCannonInventory accepts any loaded block entity with modifiable item handler, not necessarily original cannon. Replacing or moving context can bind another inventory; not original tool snapshot preservation.",
    "Entity impact writes context stack only if consumed>0. Block impact returning early because struck block is now air and fluid remains (288-290) bypasses later updateCannonStack(301-302), so do not claim every successful effect persists context mutations.",
    "No addFreshEntity result check before tank/tool fluid debit. Spawning and source consumption not atomic; creative/resource-exempt held users intentionally skip debit.",
    "Reader restores raw power/knockback/water inertia with getFloat defaults0. Public inertia setter caps0.99, but reader bypasses setter. No custom finite/range validation observed.",
    "FluidEffects.apply charges ceil(amountPerLevel * min(scale,largest-used-scale)); rounding may exceed remaining volume by documented amount. All effect implementations and datapack invariants not audited.",
    "Actual DamageFluidEffect implementation traced to attackEntitySecondary call/result; deeper combat helper/native damage events not expanded and no runtime damage QA claimed.",
    "Projectile owns liquid remainder rather than permanent player progress. Unrecognized/currently removed fluid effect recipe can cause no effect and block-hit discard; no historical recipe snapshot.",
    "Underlying Forge FluidStack codec and native Projectile owner reader not audited here; own complete pair/callers/consumer verified only.",
    "FireMode defaultSMART after load despite DUMB item launch; acceleration default1.05 differs DUMB1.5 and configurable SMART. This is own source-default/load inference, not runtime reproduction.",
    "Fuel age uses tickCount and outOfFuel, neither saved in own pair; native parent serialization not inspected, so exact lifetime reset/offline behavior not asserted.",
    "Target entity is transient and SMART reacquires nearby valid targets; do not treat target cache omission alone as lost permanent entitlement.",
    "Item settings codec includes mode, but projectile does not retain full item settings component. Native item persistence implementation and external EntityFilter parsing semantics unexpanded.",
    "Explosion radius derives saved power/current config; owner authority inherited from parent unexpanded. No paid ammunition recovery guarantee on spawn rejection."
  ],
